{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:23 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:23 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:23 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img alt=\"TVB台慶收視報捷 跨平台最高25.1點 觀眾人數162萬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/68acae7fa594923400bc7f0433e66e02/2026-11/cats1_92.jpg\"/><p>TVB 年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》已於昨晚(19日) 圓滿舉行，在匯聚逾二百位藝員傾力獻技帶來連場大型精彩表演下，跨平台直播收視錄得最高25.1點，觀眾人數162萬。而官方社交平台影片播放量更超過2,400萬(升35%)，成績斐然。</p><img alt=\"魔音女團上台獻唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b53dce6484152f37a113776765bae189/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_11_02_23_PM_3__0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"在匯聚逾二百位藝員傾力獻技、帶來連場大型精彩表演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d7fa85e4e6d8249a0f818bd010ff0c82/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_11_18_13_PM_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"陳煒、姚子羚、陳敏之等性感演出令人眼前一亮。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/84e0c2ac4c45925d5f44c0c08dd51754/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_22_09_09_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"許志安壓軸唱金曲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0efb7fe6306628c009ee96513ecfaf4c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_22_10_22_1.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:44:02.167161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:17:54.824664+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:37:34.991694+00:00","content_hash":"a43b7393408ef250d8abda7cc9fb443f36cb04c1018eaa1f5513be1c37fcaec7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}